OL,3,GNEWSARangers fan jailed for attacking
OL,4,ACeltic staff member during pitch
OL,5,Ainvasion
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Rangers fan who attacked a Celtic
OL,8,Fstaff member after invading the pitch
OL,9,Fat Ibrox has been jailed for 18 months.
OL,11,FMarc Spence, 48, grabbed first team
OL,12,Fmasseur Allan Baird and pulled him to
OL,13,Fthe ground on 8 March 2026.
OL,15,FRangers were hosting Celtic in a
OL,16,FScottish Cup quarter final tie, which
OL,17,Fthe visitors won on penalties after a
OL,18,Fgoalless draw. A large number of fans
OL,19,Ffrom both clubs went on the pitch after
OL,20,Fthe match ended.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
